t1bridge-ubuntu (@VERSION@) @SERIES@; urgency=medium

  * Ubuntu packaging of T1Bridge v0.1.12 (upstream commit 81cbdf8).
  * apple_t1_socw module for the T1 sleep/wake call (ASOC.SOCW).
  * ufw rule for the xART port on the T1 link only; initrd rebuild on
    install and removal (dracut copies the DKMS modules).
  * Link order fix for --as-needed toolchains (debian/patches).
  * GNOME/PipeWire desktop provider: volume, mute and media buttons.
  * Upgrades keep the T1 services running and restart them afterwards.
  * Touch Bar on the GDM login screen: userdb membership drop-ins put GDM's
    dynamic greeter user in group t1bridge (replaces the 0.1.12-3 ACL hook).
  * Touch Bar renderer restarts on every graphical login, also when the user
    manager outlived a logout.

 -- Niels Onderbeke <niels.onderbeke@gmail.com>  @DATE@
